<title>USA: Cox Radio names Ferguson chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Cox Radio names Ferguson chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cox Radio Inc said Thursday that it has named Richard Ferguson vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Ferguson was president and chief executive of NewCity Communications Inc, which Cox recently acquired. Cox said Ferguson is expected to join its board in May.</p>
<p>Cox Radio Inc said the NewCity acquisition added 18 radio stations in seven markets to its 25 stations.</p>
